# {{lb|en|computing}}:
## A logical or physical construct in and from which data are transferred. {{pedia|Computer port (hardware)|Computer port}}
## A female connector of an electronic device, into which a cable's male connector can be inserted.
## {{lb|en|also|networking}} A number that delimits a connection for specific processes or parts of a network service.

